### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### GET /v1/orders/{id} — Get order by ID
### OrderController.getOrder
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

@orderBase = {{host}}/v1/orders

###
# @name get-order-ok
### [1] Happy path (expect 200)
GET {{orderBase}}/{{orderId}}

###
# @name get-order-not-found
### [2] Non-existent UUID (expect 404)
GET {{orderBase}}/{{randomUuid}}

###
# @name get-order-malformed-id
### [3] Malformed UUID (expect 400)
GET {{orderBase}}/not-a-uuid
